@startuml

title Authorising, applying and undoing a fixing

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

participant "Fixing source" as source
actor "Operations" as ops
participant "Fixing management" as fm
participant "Product services" as products
database "Trades" as trades

== Subscribe ==
products -> fm : a booked trade names its fixing schedule
note right of fm : only sources that a live trade needs are followed

== Observe ==
source -> fm : publish the observation
fm -> fm : store it once, unofficial

== Authorise ==
ops -> fm : compare with the front-office rate
ops -> fm : authorise, or overkey and authorise
fm -> fm : mark official; keep the published value

== Apply ==
fm -> products : fix event (observation, version)
products -> trades : find the trades whose schedule names it
products -> trades : book coupons, fixing trades and cash,\nlabelled with the event
products --> fm : progress; excluded books reported

== Undo ==
ops -> fm : undo for all trades, a time, a book,\na currency or a trade
fm -> products : undo event (scope)
products -> trades : reverse every action labelled\nwith the fix event
fm -> fm : mark unofficial

@enduml
